Description: Radio for The Lunduke Computer Operating System
 Listen-O-Matic is a gtkmm-3 kitchen radio: live streams and podcast
 shows on one face, six presets per band, a Memory list, and a now-playing
 well. Not a feed reader and not a local file player.
